43 reviewed SVGs were retrieved through the public IconMCP get_icon tool.
Outline style, 24px, 1.75px stroke, radius 2 on the service's 16-unit grid.
Exact source names and SHA-256 digests are in manifest.json.

The official licence page states that a few hand shapes follow Phosphor,
Tabler and Lucide. Their upstream notices are included for the gesture icon:
- Phosphor Icons: https://github.com/phosphor-icons/core/blob/main/LICENSE
- Tabler Icons: https://github.com/tabler/tabler-icons/blob/main/LICENSE
- Lucide Icons: https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide/blob/main/LICENSE

No runtime network request or IconMCP account is required by the application.
